      "text": "⚡🇰🇮 🇨🇳 Kiribati's parliament is set to vote on a bill that would amend its constitution to prevent future governments from switching diplomatic recognition back to Taiwan.\n\nKiribati has switched diplomatic recognition between China and Taiwan three times, with the latest in 2019. \n\nThe constitutional amendment will ensure that Taiwan will not be recognised again. \n\n@medmannews",
